  "title": "Kirby Problem 3.1",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Classify the smallest volume hyperbolic 3-manifolds of various types. In particular:\n\n(a) Determine the nonorientable closed hyperbolic 3-manifolds of least volume.\n\n(b) Determine the n-cusped hyperbolic 3-manifolds of least volume for each $n\\geq 3$.\n\n(c) Determine the smallest volume hyperbolic 3-manifolds with n orientable cusps for each n.\n\n(d) Determine the n-cusped orientable hyperbolic 3-manifolds of least volume for each n.",
